                                                "sense_id": "fe24c859-50f4-341a-9c13-911611d4f4bc",
                                                "text": "In this dire emergence, the Marquis de Torcy, minister for foreign affairs, offered his services."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ed832ab-610d-47de-8a94-b42c25ed1a9f",
                                                "sense_id": "fe24c859-50f4-341a-9c13-911611d4f4bc",
                                                "text": "I[…]had recourse to an English Merchant, Mr Gregory, long settled at Dunkirk, to whom, happily, I had been recommended, as to a person capable, in any emergence, to afford me assistance."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
